GreyHaven compatibility data
============================

Curated data in this directory (distros.yaml, rules/, modules.yaml, caveats.yaml and any
other hand-written files) is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC-BY-4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: "GreyHaven contributors".

Generated indexes (indexes/*.idx.gz) are machine-extracted lists of hardware IDs. Each
file's header records exactly where it came from (package URL and SHA-256):

- indexes/<distro-kernel>.idx.gz: device ID tables from Linux kernel modules (GPL-2.0)
  as shipped in each distribution's kernel package.
- indexes/packages-*.idx.gz: the "Modaliases" fields of distribution package indexes.
- indexes/libfprint-*.idx.gz: libfprint's udev hwdb (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Hardware ID lists are factual data. They are redistributed here with attribution to
their upstream projects, and GreyHaven makes no additional claim over them.
